OL,3,AMan charged after woman and her niece
OL,4,Adied in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder following a fatal house fire in
OL,8,Fwhich a woman and her seven-year-old
OL,9,Fniece died.
OL,11,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died in the blaze
OL,12,Fin Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 26 August, along
OL,14,Fwith Valentina Foster.
OL,16,FJaden Wright has been charged with two
OL,17,Fcounts of murder as well as multiple
OL,18,Fgrievous bodily harm offences,
OL,19,FCleveland Police said.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
