OL,3,ALaundry rooms to be turned into cells
OL,4,Ato tackle prison overcrowding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is spending #110m on
OL,7,Fcreating more cells in existing prisons
OL,8,Fin England and Wales as part of its
OL,9,Fplans to tackle overcrowding.
OL,11,FThe money, which will come from
OL,12,Fexisting budgets, will be used to
OL,13,Fconvert unused office space, laundry
OL,14,Frooms and storage space into cells, the
OL,15,FMinistry of Justice said.
OL,17,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris is due to
OL,18,Fgive more details in the Commons later
OL,19,Fon changes to the early release scheme,
OL,20,Fwhich aims to free up space in prisons
OL,21,Fas they near maximum capacity.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
